#: crates/leh-gtk/src/app.rs:189
msgid "Switch to Bridge mode?"
msgstr "¿Cambiar al modo Puente?"

#: crates/leh-gtk/src/app.rs:190
msgid "Devices will join your wired network and get addresses from your router. Your wired connection drops for a few seconds while the bridge is set up."
msgstr "Los dispositivos se unirán a tu red cableada y recibirán direcciones de tu router. La conexión cableada se cortará unos segundos mientras se configura el puente."

