msgid "Install the helper"
msgstr "Instalar el servicio auxiliar"

#: crates/leh-gtk/src/app.rs:259
msgid "Per-device speed limits, approval and data caps need a small helper that runs with administrator rights.\n\nOn Linux Mint, run:\n\nsudo apt install linuxeasyhotspot"
